  "document": "Engineer scratchpad - uncontrolled\n\n- Remember: EP-03 current is RMS phasor magnitude. Scope screenshot from bench uses peak scale, so 2 Arms would be 2.828 A peak if converted to instantaneous sine amplitude.\n- Old v1 model sigma=0.05 is not release truth.\n- Useful/core = 1 - sigma. With sigma=.08 -> .92.\n- Gap + leakage are parallel: same magnetic voltage, different flux.\n- Do not put total Phi_core into gap B calculation.\n- Physical prototype measured ~1.58 mm gap, but analytic case is 1.50 mm.\n- Excitation induced U is positive orientation; measurement coil negative. Magnitudes are both proportional to ramp.\n- Linear benchmark only. Saturation discussion belongs to a separate nonlinear inductor case.\n",
